    {
      "id": "uQGVp42sfbHsN0ORv5eu3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1412.3333333333333,
      "y": 1975.6111111111109,
      "width": 790.2197265625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 787370260,
      "version": 368,
      "versionNonce": 922290580,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783410272177,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "【组装输入】把 data_point 转换为不同模型的输入格式（3大类）:\n    1. video generation models（仅支持文+图输入）\n    2. 3D scene generation models（支持GT相机矩阵，内部用PyTorch3D驱动渲染）\n    3. 4D scene generation models（支持GT相机矩阵）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "【组装输入】把 data_point 转换为不同模型的输入格式（3大类）:\n    1. video generation models（仅支持文+图输入）\n    2. 3D scene generation models（支持GT相机矩阵，内部用PyTorch3D驱动渲染）\n    3. 4D scene generation models（支持GT相机矩阵）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PX36CACO_VEm4KoGhtuCG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265,
      "y": 1685.611111111111,
      "width": 705.3798217773438,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 272744492,
      "version": 529,
      "versionNonce": 320037652,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783410273418,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "【数据解析】把原始数据 (dataset) 加载并解析为内部数据格式 (data_point)\n    1. 将镜头语言 (camera_path) 翻译为相机矩阵 (GT)\n    2. 将镜头语言 (camera_path) 翻译为 prompt\n    3. 按照镜头语言 (camera_path) 拆帧、生成锚点帧",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "【数据解析】把原始数据 (dataset) 加载并解析为内部数据格式 (data_point)\n    1. 将镜头语言 (camera_path) 翻译为相机矩阵 (GT)\n    2. 将镜头语言 (camera_path) 翻译为 prompt\n    3. 按照镜头语言 (camera_path) 拆帧、生成锚点帧",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
