      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Static 数据样例（物体静、相机动）：\n{\n  \"visual_movement\": \"static\",\n  \"visual_style\": \"photorealistic\",\n  \"scene_type\": \"indoor\",\n  \"camera_path\": [\"pan_left\",\"move_left\",\"pull_out\"],\n  \"image\": \"static/style_a/indoor/bedroom_001/image.jpg\",\n  \"style\": \"warm lighting\",\n  \"prompt_list\": [ \n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed. warm lighting\",\n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed and a window. warm lighting\",\n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed, a window, and a desk. warm lighting\",\n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed, a window, a desk, and a closet. warm lighting\"]\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Static 数据样例（物体静、相机动）：\n{\n  \"visual_movement\": \"static\",\n  \"visual_style\": \"photorealistic\",\n  \"scene_type\": \"indoor\",\n  \"camera_path\": [\"pan_left\",\"move_left\",\"pull_out\"],\n  \"image\": \"static/style_a/indoor/bedroom_001/image.jpg\",\n  \"style\": \"warm lighting\",\n  \"prompt_list\": [ \n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed. warm lighting\",\n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed and a window. warm lighting\",\n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed, a window, and a desk. warm lighting\",\n        \"a cozy bedroom with a bed, a window, a desk, and a closet. warm lighting\"]\n}",
